Fontaudio 1.1
=============

This application bundles the complete Fontaudio desktop font from the pinned
upstream source:
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fefanto/fontaudio/1.1/font/fontaudio.ttf

The bundled font file is Fontaudio 1.1, copyright (c) 2019 Michelangelo Nottoli,
and is licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. The complete license text
is provided in OFL-1.1.txt.

The Fontaudio project's non-font source/code is licensed under the MIT License;
the complete upstream MIT text is provided in MIT.txt for attribution and
license-boundary reference. This application does not bundle Fontaudio's SVG or
JavaScript icon files. Those upstream icon files are separately identified by
Fontaudio as CC BY 4.0 and are not covered by this bundled-font notice.

Fontaudio project: https://github.com/fefanto/fontaudio
